#~ msgid ""
#~ "typing;trainer;touch typing;keyboard;speed;wpm;words per "
#~ "minute;accuracy;test;"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "jynnskrifa;dyskador;toch jynnskrifa;bysowek;tooth;wpm;geryow dre "
#~ "mynysen;kewderder;apposyans;"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "There is no doubt that typing on a keyboard is an essential skill in the "
#~ "digital age. Typing fast and accurately gives you more opportunities, "
#~ "more time for what matters to you, and a sense of self-accomplishment."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Yma mar vyth, ow jynnskrifa war'n bysowek yw unn sleyneth a res y'n oos "
#~ "besyel. Ow jynnskrifa snell hag yn kewar ri ty moy spassow, moy termyn "
#~ "rag pyth a vern dhe ty, ha'n klewans a omhedhyans."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Keypunch lets you practice typing. Thanks to fast-paced sessions with "
#~ "instant feedback afterwards and a plethora of available languages, you "
#~ "might even have a little fun doing so. With determination, proper "
#~ "technique and some time, you will observe a noticeable increase in both "
#~ "the speed and the accuracy of which your thoughts and ideas are put into "
#~ "words on the screen."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Alhwedhen-Toller gasa ty omassaya ow jynnskrifa. Meur ras dhe esedhogow "
#~ "snell gans dasliv desempis a-wosa ha meur a yethow kavadow, martesen ty a "
#~ "wra omlowenhe dres yth. Gans mynnas krev, teknek fytti ha nebes termyn, "
#~ "ty a wra avisya moy tooth ha kewerder rag settya dha tybyansow yn geryow "
#~ "war'n skrin."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "If you are already a racer at typing, Keypunch still has something for "
#~ "you. Try practicing with numbers and punctuation, or choose your own text "
#~ "to type out as fast as you can."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Mar os jynnskrifer konnyk seulabrys, Alhwedhen-Toller kavos neppyth rag "
#~ "ty hwath. Assaya owth omassaya gans niverow ha poyntyans, po dewis dha "
#~ "tekst rag jynnskrifa es snell es ty a yll."

#~ msgid "Get ready to accelerate your typing!"
#~ msgstr "Ombareusi dhe uskishe dha ow jynnskrifa!"

#~ msgid ""
